                new("w-setup-2", "Add the services",
                    "Where: Services.\nDo: press 'Add suggested services', then change names, prices and times to the shop's real list. Set a deposit only if the shop wants one.\nSay: The 'Other' service is for anything not listed; the customer writes what they need."),
                new("w-setup-3", "Add the staff and their hours",
